        "name": "Access Collapse: MOBILE+ → STRAINED → IMPAIRED → CRITICAL_ACCESS_FAILURE",
        "metadata": {
          "description": "Tracks progressive transportation access collapse. In rural and low-income urban areas, loss of a vehicle (breakdown, repossession) or transit program changes can instantly eliminate care access for patients dependent on dialysis, oncology, or specialty chronic disease management. The MOBILE+ baseline requires confirmed transportation before collapse can be signaled.",
          "path": "MOBILE+ → STRAINED → IMPAIRED → output[1,0,0,0]",
